{"name":"Shasuna","question":"what is my destiny","reading":"You have been avoiding a truth you already know. Every distraction you reach for is proof of its weight. The longer you wait, the louder it will become.","quote1":"Everyone is a genius at least once a year. A real genius has his original ideas closer together. ","quote2":"When the solution is simple, God is answering.   ","quote3":"Someone is special only if you tell them.   ","_id":"lWgqG75HewLsiCYe"}
{"name":"Shasuna","question":"what is my destiny","reading":"Your heart is blocked by a past you refuse to release. You have built walls where there should be windows. What once protected you is now keeping you prisoner.","quote1":"We cannot do everything at once, but we can do something at once.   ","quote2":"Build a better mousetrap and the world will beat a path to your door.  ","quote3":"Passion creates the desire for more and action fuelled by passion creates a future.  ","_id":"4sLLJhRaxZm4PEs5"}
